<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#141110">
<title>Athlete · WellnessSync</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;700;900&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#141110;--s1:#1b1712;--s2:#211c16;--s3:#2b241b;--border:#322a20;--border2:#463a2b;--accent:#e8622b;--adim:rgba(232,98,43,0.12);--green:#8ec63f;--gdim:rgba(142,198,63,0.12);--yellow:#f0a92b;--red:#ef4d4d;--blue:#3ea6c4;--text:#efe7da;--muted:#8a8177;--muted2:#4a4237;--disp:'Archivo',sans-serif;--mono:'Space Mono',monospace;--sans:'Inter',sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--sans);min-height:100vh;padding-bottom:150px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
body::after{content:'';position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:340px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 75% 100% at 50% -35%,rgba(232,98,43,0.10),transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
.wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 15px}
.kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px;text-transform:uppercase}
.prof-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:6px}
.prof-cur{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.prof-cur b{color:var(--accent)}
.prof-switch{display:flex;gap:5px}
.prof-switch button{background:var(--s3);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.prof-switch button.on{background:var(--accent);color:#1a0f08;border-color:var(--accent)}
.prof-hint{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted2);margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:0.3px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:5px;background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:4px;margin-bottom:16px}
.tab{flex:1;background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;padding:10px 4px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.15s}
.tab.active{background:var(--accent);color:#1a0f08}
.sess{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:0.82;letter-spacing:-2px;margin-bottom:12px}
.sess span{display:block;font-size:50px}
.sess .int{color:var(--accent)}
.sess-meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.5}
.topline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.weekcount{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text);background:var(--gdim);border:1px solid rgba(142,198,63,0.3);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 12px}
.weekcount b{color:var(--green)}
.chip{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 12px;cursor:pointer}
.chip.on{color:var(--accent);border-color:rgba(232,98,43,0.4);background:var(--adim)}
.view-title{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:30px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:6px}
.view-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.5}
.philosophy{background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.philosophy b{color:var(--text)}

.phase-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:22px 0 10px}
.phase-h .pn{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
.phase-h .pr{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}

.ex{background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ex.guided{padding:13px 16px}
.ex.power{border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:var(--adim)}
.ex-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:2px}
.ex-name{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:18px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.3px}
.ex.guided .ex-name{font-size:16px}
.st-badge{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);background:var(--adim);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle}
.ex-pb{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--yellow)}
.ex-target{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
.ex.guided .ex-target{margin-bottom:8px}
.cmp{color:var(--muted2)}
.note-pill{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--yellow);margin-left:6px}
.set-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:7px}
.set-n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);width:16px;text-align:center;flex-shrink:0}
.set-w,.set-r{flex:1;background:var(--s3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;padding:11px;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;font-size:16px;text-align:center;outline:none;min-width:0}
.set-w:focus,.set-r:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.set-x{color:var(--muted2);font-family:var(--mono);flex-shrink:0}
.set-done{width:42px;height:42px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--border2);background:var(--s3);color:var(--muted2);font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.15s}
.set-row.done .set-done{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--bg)}
.set-row.done .set-w,.set-row.done .set-r{border-color:rgba(142,198,63,0.3);color:var(--green)}
.rest-btn{width:100%;margin-top:8px;background:var(--adim);border:1px solid rgba(232,98,43,0.3);color:var(--accent);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}
.done-btn{width:100%;margin-top:2px;background:var(--s3);border:1px solid var(--border2);color:var(--muted);border-radius:10px;padding:11px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.15s}
.done-btn.on{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--bg)}

.rest-day{text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.rest-day .big{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:44px;color:var(--text);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}

.wk-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .12s,background .12s}
.wk-row:active{transform:scale(0.995)}
.wk-row.sel{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--adim);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent) inset}
.wk-row.today{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--adim)}
.wk-done{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--green);margin-left:6px}
.wk-tod{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:6px}
.wk-day{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);width:34px;flex-shrink:0}
.wk-row.today .wk-day,.wk-row.sel .wk-day{color:var(--accent)}
.wk-body{flex:1}
.wk-name{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:17px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.3px}
.wk-int{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.wk-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0}
.tag-lift{background:var(--adim);color:var(--accent)} .tag-rest{background:var(--s3);color:var(--muted)}

.finish-wrap{position:fixed;bottom:74px;left:0;right:0;z-index:90;padding:12px 15px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;display:none}
.finish-btn{width:100%;background:var(--green);color:var(--bg);border:none;border-radius:12px;padding:15px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)}
.finish-btn.saved{background:var(--s3);color:var(--green);border:1px solid var(--green)}
.rest-bar{position:fixed;bottom:74px;left:0;right:0;z-index:95;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 15px;display:none}
.rest-bar.show{display:block}
.rest-inner{background:var(--accent);color:#1a0f08;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
.rest-inner.over{background:var(--green);color:var(--bg)}
.rest-label{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.rest-time{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;font-size:26px;flex:1;letter-spacing:-1px}
.rest-inner button{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);border:none;color:inherit;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}

.nav{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(20,17,16,0.92);backdrop-filter:blur(24px);border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:10px 0 max(10px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
.nav-link{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:5px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 8px}
.nav-link svg{width:21px;height:21px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.nav-link.active{color:var(--accent)}
.nav-link.active::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-11px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:0 0 3px 3px;background:var(--accent)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker" id="kicker">TODAY</div>

  <div class="prof-bar">
    <div class="prof-cur">Device: <b id="profName">Dave</b></div>
    <div class="prof-switch" id="profSwitch">
      <button data-a="dave" onclick="setDeviceProfile('dave')">Dave</button>
      <button data-a="heath" onclick="setDeviceProfile('heath')">Heath</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prof-hint">Sets who this device tracks \u2014 each person's logs, PBs and history stay separate.</div>

  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" id="tab-today" onclick="switchView('today')">Session</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tab-week" onclick="switchView('week')">Week</button>
  </div>

  <div class="view" id="todayView">
    <h1 class="sess"><span id="sessionName">SESSION</span><span class="int" id="sessionInt"></span></h1>
    <div class="sess-meta" id="sessionMeta"></div>
    <div id="sessionBody"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="view" id="weekView" style="display:none">
    <h2 class="view-title">The Week</h2>
    <div class="view-note">Tap any session to load and do it \u2014 miss a day, come back to it whenever. Green \u2713 = you've done it today.</div>
    <div id="weekList"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="finish-wrap" id="finishWrap"><button class="finish-btn" id="finishBtn" onclick="finishSession()">Finish Session</button></div>

<div class="rest-bar" id="restBar"><div class="rest-inner" id="restInner">
  <span class="rest-label" id="restLabel">Rest</span>
  <span class="rest-time" id="restTime">0:00</span>
  <button onclick="addRest(30)">+30</button>
  <button onclick="stopRest()">Skip</button>
</div></div>

